      "content": "SP 8607, SP 8707           WENDOVER              AYLESBURY ROAD                                                  east side 10/193 11/193                                           No.18 Lime Cottage GV                                               II House. C18 front to older structure. Brick. Old tile roof, chimney to LH, dentil brick eaves. 2-storeys. Two 3-light casements with single brick segmental arches to lst floor. Similar 5-light casement to ground floor RH, 6-panel door, 2 upper glazed, with canted bay window to LH both under a flat hood. Listing NGR: SP8695707959"
